  "role": "American actor and film producer; environmental activist and UN Messenger of Peace on climate (2014)",
  "summary": "An actor whose public political activity centres almost entirely on climate change and conservation, through his foundation, documentaries and UN appearances. He has called for carbon pricing, an end to fossil fuel subsidies and large-scale government action, and has backed Democratic presidential candidates, most explicitly Kamala Harris in 2024 on climate grounds. He has said little in public about most other policy areas.",
